      "text": "6-Day Peru Tour: Lima, Cusco and Machu Picchu"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0a45283e9056eb2b224d9491ea352c2ca9466aad99b2d9af898c0a82ab762bae",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-ddf5eabec8e2",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Spend 6 days exploring three highlights of Peru’s classic route: Lima, Cusco and Machu Picchu. In the capital, the itinerary takes you from the Miraflores waterfront to the colonial centre and the Larco Museum. In the Andes, you’ll see Cusco’s Inca monuments, visit Machu Picchu and spend a full day in the Sacred Valley."
